'''Nimue''' is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that only appears in the [[Million Arthur Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nimue
|image = E 072.png
|appearance = Million Arthur Collab Stages
|money drop = 996円 - 3,934円
}}

==Enemy==
A rather weak enemy: low health, low attack, low range, and basically low in every stat she has. She is not anything too threatening to deal with.

==Strategy==
In [[One Million Stories]], she is utterly defenseless to the point where even the weakest attackers can pick on her. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] is plenty enough to defeat her while ignoring the [[Those Guys]] that appear, and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] is straight-up overkill. She does get "stronger" in [[A Place of Skill]], though hilariously, she is still weaker than [[The Face]] in [[Empire of Cats]]' first chapter. The same strategy works for her as last time.

